WEBVTT

00:00:19.350 --> 00:00:21.830
The world is in the Gourmet Age.

00:00:22.610 --> 00:00:25.440
Gourmet Hunters are explorers 
who travel the world,

00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:28.940
searching for your ingredients.

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:32.810
And the ingredient at the top of this world

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:35.320
is GOD, which is being sought

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:38.120
by one Gourmet Hunter.

00:00:44.340 --> 00:00:47.190
Go! Shock!! Gourmet!! Gourmet!!

00:00:51.070 --> 00:00:53.640
Go! Shock!!

00:00:55.450 --> 00:00:58.320
Friends who can eat the same dream

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:01.100
Friends who share the same future

00:01:01.320 --> 00:01:03.760
With you guys

00:01:03.760 --> 00:01:06.900
It’s first-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:09.340
If we join forces

00:01:09.650 --> 00:01:12.340
We’ll be invincible

00:01:12.340 --> 00:01:15.940
Come on, let’s show ‘em

00:01:17.840 --> 00:01:23.520
Delicious food gives life

00:01:23.520 --> 00:01:29.020
So be thankful for everything and

00:01:29.140 --> 00:01:31.100
Let’s eat!!

00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:34.100
We can’t lose!! We can’t be stopped!!

00:01:34.100 --> 00:01:37.100
We ain’t gonna let ‘em have that

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:42.340
We’re gonna win it!! Shock! 
Shock! Gourmet king!!

00:01:42.340 --> 00:01:45.340
Spiked Punch!! Infinity!!

00:01:45.340 --> 00:01:49.340
I’ll punch through with this fist

00:01:49.340 --> 00:01:53.200
First-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:56.160
Let’s gather ‘round the table

00:01:56.160 --> 00:02:00.100
For the sake of tomorrow

00:02:00.100 --> 00:02:02.160
Let’s go! Go! Gourmet!!

00:02:08.790 --> 00:02:14.310
Gourmet Corp.'s army raided the 
Fest to abduct all the chefs.

00:02:14.460 --> 00:02:18.430
Toriko and Starjun had a fierce battle.

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:23.300
Meanwhile, Coco intercepted Grinpatch.

00:02:23.300 --> 00:02:26.890
His adversary's extraordinary 
tenacity made it a hard fight,

00:02:26.890 --> 00:02:28.560
but to end the battle,

00:02:28.560 --> 00:02:32.760
Coco disappeared with 
Grinpatch down a giant hole.

00:02:33.360 --> 00:02:36.720
Change of venue?! Where are we going?!

00:02:36.720 --> 00:02:38.500
A place where I can do my worst.

00:02:38.960 --> 00:02:41.480
If worse comes to worst, I'll have to use...

00:02:41.480 --> 00:02:42.540
...that poison!

00:02:45.780 --> 00:02:48.690
And Sunny, who confronted Tommyrod,

00:02:48.690 --> 00:02:51.220
found himself surrounded 
by a swarm of insects!

00:02:52.200 --> 00:02:55.320
Disgusting! Grody to the max!

00:02:59.730 --> 00:03:03.460
Duel! Sunny vs. Tommyrod!

00:03:22.250 --> 00:03:26.790
Now, die!

00:03:27.280 --> 00:03:29.650
I told you, I'm not gonna die!

00:03:30.780 --> 00:03:34.200
Hundreds of bugs with a Capture 
Level of 80 or more...

00:03:35.200 --> 00:03:37.660
No need to use it yet...

00:03:40.190 --> 00:03:44.390
Super Spatula!

00:03:52.350 --> 00:03:53.730
Huh...

00:04:06.660 --> 00:04:07.760
Toriko...

00:04:08.710 --> 00:04:12.160
You should savor my skills.

00:04:28.830 --> 00:04:31.340
All those attacks I hit him with

00:04:31.340 --> 00:04:33.230
and not a one had any effect on him?!

00:04:33.950 --> 00:04:35.400
Starjun...

00:04:35.720 --> 00:04:37.990
You really are one tough bastard!

00:05:00.700 --> 00:05:01.680
What the...?

00:05:02.650 --> 00:05:03.780
An insect?!

00:05:08.930 --> 00:05:09.990
Sunny-san!

00:05:10.500 --> 00:05:11.920
Stay back, Komatsu!

00:05:12.320 --> 00:05:13.990
It's dangerous, so get out of here!

00:05:15.180 --> 00:05:16.430
Right!

00:05:16.430 --> 00:05:17.300
Let's go, Yun!

00:05:19.530 --> 00:05:22.630
Super Spatula!

00:05:24.330 --> 00:05:28.140
This should be the first time 
he's seen these insects,

00:05:28.140 --> 00:05:32.240
yet he's attacking their 
vital spots with precision.

00:05:32.770 --> 00:05:33.780
Gut Instinct?

00:05:34.870 --> 00:05:37.850
He's controlling sensors that 
are invisible to the naked eye.

00:05:38.320 --> 00:05:42.330
And they far outnumber the 
insects I can produce.

00:05:43.670 --> 00:05:45.560
Interesting!

00:06:07.340 --> 00:06:09.190
A viscous gas...

00:06:09.190 --> 00:06:11.880
I've already been through this 
with the Four-Beasts, dumbass!

00:06:15.610 --> 00:06:18.010
Hair Tornado!

00:06:25.010 --> 00:06:27.300
A tornado and...

00:06:27.750 --> 00:06:29.700
...shish kebab weather advisory!

00:06:29.990 --> 00:06:31.270
Hair Spit!

00:06:44.120 --> 00:06:45.010
Dinner is...

00:06:45.010 --> 00:06:46.180
...serv...

00:07:00.650 --> 00:07:03.430
This one's a pain in the ass.

00:07:05.120 --> 00:07:11.070
No creature in the Human World 
can cut that hair of yours.

00:07:11.070 --> 00:07:13.190
But this Giant Parasite

00:07:13.190 --> 00:07:16.230
is a Gourmet World hybrid

00:07:16.230 --> 00:07:19.520
bred specifically for sharpness.

00:07:20.090 --> 00:07:22.840
And it has a ton of ganglions too.

00:07:23.320 --> 00:07:25.820
Too many to control even 
with Hair Marionette.

00:07:26.270 --> 00:07:29.550
And I've got a lot more like that on the way!

00:07:30.040 --> 00:07:32.060
Play nice with them!

00:07:43.570 --> 00:07:45.140
For you,

00:07:45.500 --> 00:07:48.090
having one strand of hair cut

00:07:48.090 --> 00:07:52.100
is about as painful as 
having a tooth yanked out

00:07:52.100 --> 00:07:53.990
without anesthetic, isn't it?

00:07:54.800 --> 00:07:58.420
But you've got hundreds 
of thousands of strands.

00:07:58.420 --> 00:08:01.360
The level of pain would make 
an average person die of shock.

00:08:05.190 --> 00:08:07.400
P-Pain...

00:08:08.380 --> 00:08:10.350
...isn't something that runs 
through the whole body.

00:08:18.680 --> 00:08:20.020
What should I do?!

00:08:20.020 --> 00:08:21.350
The president's cup!

00:08:24.140 --> 00:08:25.210
Sunny...

00:08:32.740 --> 00:08:33.590
Um...

00:08:34.070 --> 00:08:36.270
I-I'm sor...

00:08:40.680 --> 00:08:42.890
Are you okay, Sunny?

00:08:50.240 --> 00:08:51.680
Let's get you patched up.

00:09:06.370 --> 00:09:09.550
It was such a beautiful cup...

00:09:10.800 --> 00:09:12.600
...that I touched it without thinking.

00:09:13.510 --> 00:09:14.420
I'm sorry!

00:09:15.690 --> 00:09:17.740
Even though it's a treasure

00:09:18.450 --> 00:09:20.310
that's precious to you, President...

00:09:21.150 --> 00:09:22.060
Sunny...

00:09:23.570 --> 00:09:26.470
Everything that has a form breaks eventually.

00:09:27.810 --> 00:09:30.290
But that's also the moment

00:09:31.090 --> 00:09:34.070
when it becomes illuminated in your memories.

00:09:36.360 --> 00:09:39.490
That's because the things that are 
really important and beautiful

00:09:40.070 --> 00:09:42.390
are what lie in your heart.

00:09:44.710 --> 00:09:48.590
All of them... are in your heart.

00:09:50.970 --> 00:09:52.040
Pain...

00:09:53.730 --> 00:09:55.210
...stabs through the heart

00:09:55.800 --> 00:09:57.470
and squeezes.

00:09:58.980 --> 00:10:00.240
Those screams...

00:10:00.880 --> 00:10:02.290
The smell of blood...

00:10:04.140 --> 00:10:06.750
The creepy guffawing of you bastards...

00:10:07.520 --> 00:10:10.120
That will squeeze my heart 
for the rest of my life.

00:10:11.810 --> 00:10:13.190
That's what...

00:10:14.890 --> 00:10:16.340
...true pain is!

00:10:19.780 --> 00:10:23.010
What are you going on about, moron?!

00:10:25.270 --> 00:10:27.280
Being plagued by

00:10:27.780 --> 00:10:29.910
these disgusting memories

00:10:31.190 --> 00:10:33.280
from here on out...

00:10:35.660 --> 00:10:37.860
...isn't one damn bit beautiful!

00:10:39.740 --> 00:10:42.620
So I'm done playing games here.

00:10:43.630 --> 00:10:45.860
I'm gonna wipe every last one of you...

00:10:46.420 --> 00:10:48.160
...off the face of this planet.

00:10:51.850 --> 00:10:52.760
What's that?

00:11:00.080 --> 00:11:01.540
Satan Hair.

00:11:37.110 --> 00:11:38.140
It's no use.

00:11:39.630 --> 00:11:41.650
This hair can't be cut.

00:11:42.430 --> 00:11:43.780
And I think

00:11:44.600 --> 00:11:46.150
you'd be better off not touching it.

00:11:48.500 --> 00:11:50.870
Each strand of this hair

00:11:51.500 --> 00:11:53.360
possesses a voracious appetite.

00:11:54.050 --> 00:11:55.990
They'll devour everything.

00:11:57.060 --> 00:11:58.890
They're demon sensors.

00:12:01.100 --> 00:12:02.700
Just a single strand

00:12:03.810 --> 00:12:06.170
could annihilate all life from the planet.

00:12:07.060 --> 00:12:10.460
They could dig into the ground, 
go through the planet's crust,

00:12:10.970 --> 00:12:12.790
and burrow into the mantle.

00:12:15.390 --> 00:12:17.770
And when there was no 
nourishment left on Earth,

00:12:17.770 --> 00:12:19.480
this demon

00:12:19.480 --> 00:12:22.990
would set its sights into space.

00:12:23.890 --> 00:12:25.740
It has a huge appetite.

00:12:28.000 --> 00:12:29.630
Insignificant bugs like you...

00:12:31.270 --> 00:12:33.470
...aren't even enough to be an appetizer!

00:13:06.060 --> 00:13:07.720
Feels like I'm going to lose consciousness...

00:13:08.180 --> 00:13:09.040
Don't send out...

00:13:10.420 --> 00:13:11.920
...any more than this!

00:13:13.590 --> 00:13:16.470
This guy... Don't tell me...

00:13:16.970 --> 00:13:19.870
...his Gourmet Cells themselves are...

00:13:20.860 --> 00:13:22.560
Interesting!

00:13:23.930 --> 00:13:27.240
I'll fight you man to man!

00:13:29.610 --> 00:13:31.190
But of course.

00:13:31.550 --> 00:13:34.020
That hair of yours...

00:13:34.020 --> 00:13:37.020
I'll rip it out at the roots...

00:13:40.910 --> 00:13:43.570
...along with your life!

00:13:45.180 --> 00:13:49.840
Do you know why I rely on 
my insects for battles?

00:13:50.370 --> 00:13:52.710
There's no special reason.

00:13:53.700 --> 00:13:57.010
It's just a pain in the ass 
for me to fight myself.

00:14:05.160 --> 00:14:07.330
Not beautiful...

00:14:08.060 --> 00:14:11.480
Whatever isn't useful is just garbage.

00:14:11.480 --> 00:14:13.470
They were in the way, so I don't need 'em.

00:14:15.080 --> 00:14:16.380
At any rate,

00:14:17.290 --> 00:14:21.110
it's rare for me to fight all-out.

00:14:21.780 --> 00:14:23.610
The last time was with Toriko.

00:14:24.230 --> 00:14:26.610
I'm gonna give that hairy head

00:14:27.080 --> 00:14:29.780
a buzz cut you'll never forget!

00:14:43.200 --> 00:14:45.330
Tear my hair out at the roots?

00:14:46.150 --> 00:14:49.300
That's gonna be hard without a hand.

00:14:55.950 --> 00:14:58.080
This power...

00:14:58.080 --> 00:14:59.680
I was right about him...

00:15:03.590 --> 00:15:04.980
That day,

00:15:04.980 --> 00:15:07.450
in the battle against the 
Four-Beasts, we activated

00:15:07.450 --> 00:15:08.950
Meal Fit for a King,

00:15:11.510 --> 00:15:13.560
in which pure appetite 
erupted from our bodies.

00:15:14.400 --> 00:15:17.230
It was the energy of our Gourmet 
Cells given physical form.

00:15:18.250 --> 00:15:19.300
At the same time,

00:15:21.050 --> 00:15:25.020
something that had been lying 
dormant within our Gourmet Cells

00:15:25.020 --> 00:15:27.310
was roused from its slumber.

00:15:29.480 --> 00:15:31.190
This is my chance.

00:15:31.620 --> 00:15:33.710
The cork's been popped.

00:15:34.270 --> 00:15:36.480
It's okay, isn't it?

00:15:37.920 --> 00:15:39.450
You don't mind...

00:15:39.450 --> 00:15:41.400
...if I come out?

00:15:43.580 --> 00:15:45.280
I couldn't

00:15:45.280 --> 00:15:47.860
get a hold of its identity,

00:15:49.240 --> 00:15:52.020
but its power...

00:15:52.020 --> 00:15:54.630
Though it only put in a brief appearance,

00:15:55.190 --> 00:15:57.870
its overwhelming energy

00:15:58.260 --> 00:16:00.020
threatened to devour me!

00:16:01.210 --> 00:16:03.370
Even now, I feel faint...

00:16:03.930 --> 00:16:05.650
I can't control it.

00:16:06.660 --> 00:16:08.750
I'd better not use this 
hair for a long period!

00:16:09.880 --> 00:16:12.020
I have to bring this fight 
to a finish with one stroke!

00:16:15.160 --> 00:16:16.950
Fast responses!

00:16:16.950 --> 00:16:18.220
Interesting!

00:16:22.960 --> 00:16:24.660
Come on! Here I am!

00:16:25.740 --> 00:16:26.720
How fast is he?!

00:16:28.010 --> 00:16:29.610
Then I won't leave you anywhere to run!

00:16:32.040 --> 00:16:33.270
It won't work.

00:16:34.160 --> 00:16:36.550
I can see everything.

00:16:37.730 --> 00:16:40.210
See, I have compound eyes.

00:16:40.790 --> 00:16:44.920
Each one shows a different part of my target.

00:16:44.920 --> 00:16:47.450
It's an aggregate of little eyes.

00:16:48.060 --> 00:16:50.860
And I have a million of them!

00:16:51.610 --> 00:16:53.790
I can even pick up

00:16:53.790 --> 00:16:56.850
your invisible sensors perfectly!

00:17:00.460 --> 00:17:05.500
He can't totally control that hair yet.

00:17:06.030 --> 00:17:10.220
The proof is that he attacks 
with it in bunches.

00:17:11.010 --> 00:17:13.860
He can't control that power to the 
extent of being able to spread out

00:17:13.860 --> 00:17:16.750
those hundreds of thousands of strands!

00:17:17.490 --> 00:17:19.500
No matter how much power you have,

00:17:19.500 --> 00:17:23.760
there's no way you'll be able to tag 
me with those beginner's sensors!

00:17:25.210 --> 00:17:28.460
Even with Honoring the Food and Gut 
Instinct, I can't use them well!

00:17:29.780 --> 00:17:33.100
Handling hair I'm not used 
to gets on my nerves!

00:17:33.410 --> 00:17:34.540
I've got no choice.

00:17:34.540 --> 00:17:35.660
Release!

00:17:36.200 --> 00:17:37.600
Dining Kitchen!

00:17:37.800 --> 00:17:40.000
Entangle him! Hair Lock!

00:17:41.010 --> 00:17:42.660
Bomb Eggs Storm!

00:17:46.500 --> 00:17:47.740
What the hell?!

00:17:47.740 --> 00:17:49.050
Bastard!

00:17:49.050 --> 00:17:50.480
Hair Spit!

00:17:50.890 --> 00:17:53.420
Harden! Wing Shield!

00:18:00.750 --> 00:18:03.180
His left arm that I blew off!

00:18:05.950 --> 00:18:07.730
It's still alive!

00:18:09.610 --> 00:18:13.010
You've only made yourself 
another powerful enemy!

00:18:13.010 --> 00:18:16.570
That arm alone would probably have 
a Capture Level of no less than 200!

00:18:17.210 --> 00:18:19.940
I-Incredible power...

00:18:20.620 --> 00:18:22.980
It'll tear my throat open!

00:18:23.210 --> 00:18:25.910
Got to... concentrate!

00:18:26.250 --> 00:18:28.950
M-Move my hair...

00:18:28.950 --> 00:18:31.080
You finally gave me an opening!

00:19:03.060 --> 00:19:04.460
The final blow...

00:19:24.590 --> 00:19:25.940
Are you dead?

00:19:30.020 --> 00:19:31.130
What's this?

00:19:32.260 --> 00:19:34.750
I can't move my hand...

00:19:35.410 --> 00:19:36.530
Wait...

00:19:36.530 --> 00:19:38.130
Not just my hand.

00:19:38.130 --> 00:19:40.100
My whole body is...

00:19:40.100 --> 00:19:41.970
I can finally

00:19:41.970 --> 00:19:43.700
control it.

00:19:46.220 --> 00:19:48.990
It does take time

00:19:49.660 --> 00:19:52.300
to control hair I'm not used to.

00:20:03.660 --> 00:20:06.100
Hair Marionette.

00:20:07.550 --> 00:20:09.010
All of your nerves

00:20:09.610 --> 00:20:11.810
belong to me.

00:20:20.500 --> 00:20:26.220
Even in a world that nobody's ever seen

00:20:26.220 --> 00:20:31.800
There's something that can be 
glimpsed if you keep chasing dreams

00:20:31.800 --> 00:20:37.260
Flowers don't bloom on top of asphalt

00:20:37.440 --> 00:20:42.620
Come on, let's go make 
only your dreams come true

00:20:42.620 --> 00:20:48.400
Mega Raba! The map that you 
draw spreads out into infinity

00:20:48.400 --> 00:20:54.100
Mega Raba! Nobody can stop you

00:20:54.100 --> 00:21:00.200
Mega Raba! Let's go forth, 
feeling excitement in our hearts

00:21:00.200 --> 00:21:05.380
Let's go find what you've been longing for

00:21:05.380 --> 00:21:06.880
Mega Raba

00:21:08.400 --> 00:21:09.660
Mega Raba

00:21:11.300 --> 00:21:12.740
Mega Raba

00:21:15.540 --> 00:21:20.530
Guess the Legend
The Legend Gourmet Quiz

00:21:16.380 --> 00:21:18.100
Guess the Legend!

00:21:18.100 --> 00:21:20.060
The Legend Gourmet Quiz!

00:21:20.770 --> 00:21:22.350
I'm your host, Tina.

00:21:22.350 --> 00:21:26.240
This is a heaping helping 
of an epoch-making segment,

00:21:26.240 --> 00:21:28.530
in which you guess the legendary 
ingredients of the Gourmet Age!

00:21:32.830 --> 00:21:38.940
Really?! Level 8

00:21:33.510 --> 00:21:36.250
Today's "Really?!" level is 8.

00:21:36.970 --> 00:21:38.930
Someone once said...

00:21:39.280 --> 00:21:42.300
Heavenly voice! Please help me today too!

00:21:42.300 --> 00:21:45.480
Sure, sure. Okay, here I go.

00:21:46.700 --> 00:21:48.750
Someone once said...

00:21:49.050 --> 00:21:52.770
There are fava beans that make 
the sounds of musical scales.

00:21:52.770 --> 00:21:55.480
Something something something 
something something!

00:21:56.090 --> 00:21:59.720
The allotted time limit is 10 seconds.

00:21:59.720 --> 00:22:01.120
Start!

00:22:02.280 --> 00:22:04.200
The sounds of musical scales?

00:22:04.200 --> 00:22:05.880
What are the musical scales?

00:22:12.370 --> 00:22:14.700
Someone once said...

00:22:14.700 --> 00:22:18.380
There are fava beans that make 
the sounds of musical scales.

00:22:15.400 --> 00:22:27.880
Do Re Mi Fava Beans

00:22:18.380 --> 00:22:24.800
Do Re Mi Fava Beans!

00:22:28.270 --> 00:22:30.240
Do Re Mi Fava Beans!

00:22:30.240 --> 00:22:33.240
That's an ingredient you can 
enjoy by mouth and ear, huh?

00:22:33.240 --> 00:22:36.440
Just be careful that you don't eat too many,

00:22:36.440 --> 00:22:40.080
or they'll make a big racket in your tummy!

00:22:41.110 --> 00:22:44.020
And now, let's get back on 
track with our next segment!
